The Jev browser engine (app/tools/jev/) ports jev-ultrafast by Browser Use
(https://github.com/browser-use/jev-ultrafast, commit 1231850a0bf1a0c0341fe408ef1668dbbfdfac46).
Its prompts (JevActionSpace), page scripts (JevPage) and conf/browser/jev-snapshot.js are carried
verbatim, and the loop, request and executor are ports of its Python. They are used under this license:

